# Global gitignore for every repository (XDG path; git reads this
# automatically). Per-repo .gitignore rules still apply on top. Keep this
# minimal: only universal junk that no project ever wants committed.

# Claude Code per-project local settings (machine-local, never shared).
**/.claude/settings.local.json

# Personal "parking lot" notes (/later) and any *.local.md scratch files.
*.local.md

# Linked git worktrees created inside the checkout (Zed's worktree picker,
# served at https://<name>.<project>.test). Git lists the directory as
# untracked otherwise; nothing in it belongs to the parent checkout.
.worktrees/

# OS metadata
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Editor swap and backup files
*.swp
*.swo
*~
